Z||000000||Kelvin Vivian||01-24-2001||07:06 AM||||Here are some production numbers that I found over the internet.<P>84 Indy Pace Car: 2,000<BR>84 Base Coupe: 7,099<BR>84 Sport Coupe: 62,070<BR>84 SE: 65,671<BR>Total 84 Production: 136,843<P>85 Base Coupe: 5,280<BR>85 Sport Coupe: 23,823<BR>85 SE 4-cyl: 12,901<BR>85 SE V6: 11,833<BR>85 GT: 22,534<BR>Total 85 Production: 76,371<P>86 Base Coupe: 9,143<BR>86 Sport Coupe: 24,866<BR>86 SE 4-cyl: 4,031<BR>86 SE V6: 28,274<BR>86 GT: 17,655<BR>Total 86 Production: 83,969<P>87 Base Coupe: 23,603<BR>87 Sport Coupe: 3,135<BR>87 SE 4-cyl: 1,401<BR>87 SE V6: 2,474<BR>87 GT: 15,966<BR>Total 87 Production: 46,579<P>88 Coupe: 13,910<BR>88 Formula: 5,684<BR>88 GT: 6,849<BR>Total 88 Production: 24,601<P>Fiero Colors:<BR>Yellow - 1,166 (88 only) (489 coupe + 436 Formula + 241 GT)<BR>Gold - 20,444 (86 16,325 + 87 4119)<BR>Blue - 4,458 (87 only)<BR>Med Red Metallic - 22,993 (87 20,264 + 88 2,729)<BR>Silver - 48,472 (color available all years)<BR>Black - 82,208 (color available all years)<BR>White - 61,440 (color available all years)<BR>Bright Red - 128,924 (color available all years except '87 (I believe))<P>Options:<BR>T-tops: 1,252 (88 option) (91 coupe + 547 Formula + 614 GT)<BR>||||reg||1
