Z||000008||RRobinson||01-24-2001||05:52 PM||||Yeah, I know some of the Canadian numbers. I have reports from GM historical services stating that there were 1086 87 GTs built for Canada, and 423 88 GTs. Also, my friend Chris has an 88 build sheet record that says there were 307 coupes, of which 137 were W66 coded (Formula). I would love to know the other years and models of Canadian build numbers. Anyone?<P>Ryan<BR>88 GT Red<BR>87 GT Blue<BR>87 GT Black<BR>87 SE V6 Med. red (New!)<P>||||reg||10
